# Phase 4, Step 4: send hook requests to cds_service.py by hand.
# Needs: HAPI running (docker start hapi) and the service running in another terminal.
# Click "Send Request" above a POST line (or put the cursor in it and press Ctrl+Alt+R).
# No prefetch is sent, so the service fetches from fhirServer (C1 fallback).

@service = http://localhost:8000/cds-services/sglt2-t2d-ckd
@fhir = http://localhost:8080/fhir

### RECOMMEND expected: Kenneth Ritchie (truth table)
POST {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hook": "patient-view",
  "hookInstance": "manual-recommend-310873",
  "fhirServer": "{{fhir}}",
  "context": { "userId": "Practitioner/example", "patientId": "310873" }
}

### INSUFFICIENT_DATA expected: Roxanne Herzog, no recent eGFR
